#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Break"
msgstr "Prekid"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Break at a template, at a location in a stylesheet or xml file loaded by "
"xsldbg, or at the current node. New for xsldbg 3.1.4: When in gdb "
"compatibility mode orphaned breakpoints can be set at a specific file and "
"line number and be resolved to an active later on."
msgstr ""
"Prekid na predložak, na lokaciji u stila ili XML datoteke koju je učito "
"xsldbg, ili na trenutni čvor. Novi za xsldbg 3.1.4: Kada je u GDB režimu "
"kompatibilnosti, nepovezane prekidne tačke se može postaviti na određenu "
"datoteku i broj linije i razložiti u aktivnu kasnije."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shortcut name: b"
msgstr "Ime kratice: B"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"xsldbg will try to guess the complete URL given a <informaltable> <tgroup "
"cols=\"1\"><tbody> <row><entry>file name without a path specified.</entry></"
"row> <row><entry>a file name in the same directory as the <quote>top</quote> "
"stylesheet loaded</entry></row> <row><entry>a file name relative to the "
"current working directory of xsldbg</entry></row> </tbody></tgroup> </"
"informaltable> Ie if you have loaded a stylesheet file of <filename>../en/"
"xsldoc.xsl</filename> you can do this"
msgstr ""
"xsldbg će pokušati pogoditi kompletan URL dati  <informaltable> <tgroup cols="
"\"1\"><tbody> <row><entry> naziv datoteke bez staze navedeno..</entry></row> "
"<row><entry> naziv datoteke u istom direktoriju kao <quote>top</quote> "
"stylesheet loaded</entry></row> <row><entry> naziv datoteke u odnosu na "
"trenutni radni direktorij xsldbg </entry></row> </tbody></tgroup> </"
"informaltable>> odnosno ako je umetnut stila datoteku <filename>../en/xsldoc."
"xsl</filename> možeš ti to"

#. Tag: userinput
#: commands.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "break -l xsldoc.xsl 26"
msgstr "break -l xsldoc.xsl 26"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This command will match a partial or complete QNAME template and or mode "
"name provided. &eg; <quote>template</quote> will match any QNAME with a "
"local part of <quote>template</quote>"
msgstr ""
"Ova naredba će odgovarati djelomičnom ili potpunom QNAME predlošku i načinu "
"rada ili imenu koje je dato. &eg; <quote>predložak</quote>  će odgovarati "
"svakom QNAME s lokalnim dijelom <quote>predloška</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any name spaces in the provided QNAME will be expanded as specified by the "
"names spaces defined in the XSL SOURCE file. &eg; <quote>xsl:test1</quote> "
"will be expanded to <quote>http://www.w3.org/199/XSL/Transform:test1</quote>"
msgstr ""
"Bilo naziv mjesta u koje QNAME će se proširiti kao što je navedeno od strane "
"imena prostore definirane u XSL izvorne datoteke. &eg; <quote>xsl:test1</"
"quote> will be expanded to <quote>http://www.w3.org/199/XSL/Transform:test1</"
"quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A requested breakpoint may need to be resolved to its associated URL and "
"line number. This is done automatically after the first template has been "
"seen by xsldbg. Breakpoints are re-validated shortly after the start of each "
"run."
msgstr ""
"A tražio prijelomna možda treba riješiti svoje povezane URL i broj linije. "
"To se radi automatski nakon prvog predložak je vide xsldbg. Breakpoints su "
"ponovno potvrđeni ubrzo nakon početka svake staze."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Automatic breakpoint validation is used when gdb mode is enabled - the "
"default behaviour of xsldbg"
msgstr ""
"Automatski prijelomna validacija se koristi kada je omogućena GDB režim - "
"default ponašanje xsldbg"

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Break usage"
msgstr "Upotreba prekida"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break -l &lt;FILENAME&gt; &lt;LINENO&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>"
"(To set breakpoint at specified file, line number)</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break -l &lt;FILENAME&gt; &lt;LINENO&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>"
"(Da biste postavili prijelomna na navedenu datoteku, broj linije)</emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break -l &lt;URI&gt; &lt;LINENO&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(To set "
"breakpoint at specified URI, line number)</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break -l &lt;URI&gt; &lt;LINENO&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Za "
"postavljanje prijelomna u određenim URI, broj linije)</emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break &lt;TEMPLATE_NAME&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(To break at "
"named or matched template.)</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break &lt;TEMPLATE_NAME&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Da bi se "
"prekinulo u imenovani ili odgovarajući predložak.)</emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break &lt;TEMPLATE_NAME&gt; &lt;MODE_NAME&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"
"<emphasis>(To break at named template with given mode.)></emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break &lt;TEMPLATE_NAME&gt; &lt;MODE_NAME&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"
"<emphasis>(Da bi se razbiti u imenu predložak s obzirom modu.)></emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break \"\" &lt;MODE_NAME&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(To break at "
"any template that has a given mode name)</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break \"\" &lt;MODE_NAME&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Da bi se "
"prekinulo u bilo koji predložak koji ima dato ime režima)</emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break *&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(To break at any template found.)</"
"emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break *&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Da bi se razbiti u bilo predložak "
"pronađeno.)</emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break \\*&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(To break at the <literal>*</"
"literal> template. Other name that include <quote>*</quote> will not be "
"treated specially.)</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break \\*&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Da bi se prekinulo na <literal> "
"* </literal> predložak. Drugo ime koje uključuje <quote> * </quote> neće "
"biti tretirano posebno.)</emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: commands.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"break &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(To break point at current node. Yes "
"that includes xml data nodes!)</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"break &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Za brejk na trenutni čvor. Da, to "
"uključuje čvorova XML podataka!)</emphasis>"

